But what does Axl Rose sound like?

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.520
Give us a taste. I hear you do Axl Rose.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.410
- You know, they were asking me back,

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:23.700
they were, like, "Have
you ever met Kelly?"

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.533
I was like,

00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:28.050
"We haven't met, but I sang
'Since You've Been Gone'

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:31.017
as Axl Rose on 'The
Tonight Show' one time."

00:00:31.017 --> 00:00:32.680
And they're like, "Oh,
you have to do Axl Rose."

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:35.156
I'm like, "That was 10
years ago, I did Axl Rose

00:00:35.156 --> 00:00:36.540
on 'The Tonight Show,' I'm a dad now."

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:38.051
And they're like, "So sing a dad song."

00:00:38.051 --> 00:00:38.884
I was, like-

00:00:38.884 --> 00:00:39.717
- We are still cool as parents.

00:00:39.717 --> 00:00:40.550
