(Kelly laughs)

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:41.510
Watch this. Okay.

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:43.430
I'm gonna do a dad song as Axl Rose.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:44.520
Hold on. Can I get a microphone?

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.871
Can I, like, oh, yeah.

00:00:45.871 --> 00:00:47.370
- [Kelly] Yes! Yes!
(audience cheers)

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:48.987
- Gotta feel it.

00:00:48.987 --> 00:00:49.953
(Kelly groans)

00:00:49.953 --> 00:00:50.786
(Joseph clears throat)

00:00:50.786 --> 00:00:51.619
- Oh, my God.
(Kelly coughs)

00:00:51.619 --> 00:00:52.452
