- Love you.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:57.452
♪ Twinkle twinkle little star ♪

00:00:59.132 --> 00:01:03.299
♪ How I wonder what you are, yeah ♪

00:01:05.525 --> 00:01:09.016
(audience cheers)
(Kelly claps)

00:01:09.016 --> 00:01:10.526
- Oh, my God.

00:01:10.526 --> 00:01:11.706
- Cool as parents, right?
- I loved it.

00:01:11.706 --> 00:01:13.342
You have to get the thing there ...

00:01:13.342 --> 00:01:14.175
- You're, right? The side-

00:01:14.175 --> 00:01:15.153
- The sides in your-

00:01:15.153 --> 00:01:17.650
