- And the bandana.

00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:18.930
I love it.

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.380
So wait, does it hurt
your throat to do that?

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.740
- Oh yeah. I'm not gonna be able to talk

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.043
